Day 13 - AI-Powered Job Discovery & Career Match System
Overview

Today I explored how AI can transform the traditional job search process by helping candidates discover high-fit opportunities based on their skills, experience, career goals, and market demand.

Instead of manually searching through hundreds of job listings, I used AI to analyze professional profiles, evaluate job requirements, identify skill gaps, and recommend the most suitable opportunities.

Project Objective

Build an AI-powered system that can:

Analyze a candidate's professional profile
Match skills with available job opportunities
Calculate job fit scores
Identify missing skills
Provide market demand insights
Recommend career growth strategies
Improve job search efficiency
